<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-G JULY NET DOWN TO PLN 164,100.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-G JULY NET DOWN TO PLN 164,100.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.16 vs   0.22</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.27 vs   0.22</p>
